  "details": "I'm not entirely sure what might be the best way to do this. For all intents and purposes, I do like the way that having a single Community Labs upload per week prevents people from spamming worlds and gaming the system. However, I have a number of old worlds that I've been updating for Quest and am bringing back to public. The way the current system is, I can only get 52 of those worlds up if, and that's if I wait an entire year and don't forget during any week. A way to request additional uploads in special cases may be helpful. Perhaps there could be a delayed publication period for additional worlds past the first one in these cases?",
